            "heading": "FIT",
            "open_close_icon": "plus_minus",
            "text": "<p>The Ultra Block Black Leggings are designed for fitness enthusiasts who value comfort and functionality. Crafted with our premium Cloud fabric, these leggings are moisture-wicking, breathable, and quick-drying to keep you cool and fresh during workouts or daily activities.<br/><br/>Featuring a regular waist and ankle-length design, these leggings ensure a snug yet flexible fit. A convenient zipper pocket at the back waistband provides secure storage for small essentials like keys or cash, making them perfect for fitness routines and outdoor adventures.<br/><br/>Built with chafe-free seams and a heat-sealed label, these leggings prioritize comfort, eliminating distractions so you can focus on your goals. Whether you're heading to the gym, practicing yoga, or running errands, these versatile black leggings will be your go-to choice.<br/><br/>Product Features:<br/><br/>Cloud Fabric: Soft, durable, and breathable material<br/>Regular Waist & Ankle Length: Designed for a flattering fit<br/>Back Zipper Pocket: Securely stores essentials like keys and cash<br/>Chafe-Free Seams: Ensures all-day comfort<br/>Heat-Sealed Label: No irritating tags to bother you<br/><br/></p>",
